"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353462942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110563#issuecomment-3353462942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110563","id":3353462942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H4cie","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T19:10:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T19:14:29Z","body":"The issue is caused by MSDF pixel range, you can't render outlines that are >= 0.5 of pixel range. Change it to a bigger value (default is 8, so max outline is 4) and it will work:\n\n<img width=\"725\" height=\"189\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b5d9b5c-347c-4f20-8ce5-bf374aae6f70\" />\n\nWe probably should add a warning if this is a case (or/and re-generate font dynamically).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353462942/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]